---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AuthorCard from '@/components/AuthorCard.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Me">
  <article class="prose max-w-none">
    <h2>Hello, I'm Yusheng Chen!</h2>

    <p>
      I'm a designer based in Taipei.
    </p>

    <h2>Professional Journey</h2>

    <p>
      With a background in computer science and a passion for technology, I've had
      the opportunity to hone my skills in system architecture and cloud computing
      while working in Taipei's tech scene.
    </p>

    <h3>Technical Expertise</h3>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Languages</strong>: Python, JavaScript, Java, Go</li>
      <li><strong>Frontend</strong>: React, Vue.js, Next.js</li>
      <li><strong>Backend</strong>: Node.js, Django, Spring Boot</li>
      <li><strong>Cloud</strong>: AWS, GCP, Azure</li>
      <li><strong>DevOps</strong>: Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD</li>
      <li><strong>Data</strong>: SQL, MongoDB, Redis</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Current Focus</h2>

    <ul>
      <li>Working on improving development workflows and automation</li>
      <li>Learning new technologies and best practices</li>
      <li>Documenting my journey through this blog</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Why This Blog?</h2>

    <p>This blog serves as my digital workspace where I:</p>

    <ul>
      <li>Share technical insights and solutions</li>
      <li>Explore the intersection of technology and design</li>
      <li>Provide practical guides and tutorials</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Connect With Me</h2>

    <ul>
      <li>GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/uilfl">uilfl</a></li>
      <li>Based in: Taipei</li>
      <li>Open for collaboration on interesting projects</li>
    </ul>

    <hr />

    <p>
      <em>Interested in collaboration or have questions about my workflow?
      Feel free to reach out through GitHub or any of the channels above!</em>
    </p>
  </article>

  <AuthorCard class="mt-10" />
</BaseLayout>
